# Buildroot users table (BR2_ROOTFS_USERS_TABLES).
# systemd ships tmpfiles.d/systemd-network.conf unconditionally (it chowns
# /run/systemd/netif and /var/lib/systemd/network to systemd-network), but the
# systemd-network user is only created by the systemd package when networkd is
# enabled. We manage networking with NetworkManager (networkd disabled), so
# create the user here to satisfy those paths and the image packer.
# fields: user uid group gid password home shell groups comment
systemd-network -1 systemd-network -1 * - - - systemd Network Management
